## Context Loading Strategy

**Level 1 (Always Loaded):** ~600 tokens

- `CLAUDE.md` + `core/` files
- Loaded in every Claude session

**Level 2 (Contextual):** ~150-300 tokens each

- Specific `rules/` subfolder based on task
- Load 1-3 rules per typical session

**Level 3 (On-Demand):** ~50-150 tokens each

- `templates/` + `snippets/` as needed
- Load only when generating code

**Target:** 1,200-2,000 tokens per session (70% reduction from before)

